... ### 3. Platform Sweep
... **Goal**: Direct check of major platforms.
... 
... ```
... Query: "<FIRST LAST>" <known location/employer>
... Include domains: [
...   "facebook.com", "instagram.com", "twitter.com", "x.com",
...   "tiktok.com", "linkedin.com", "pinterest.com", "youtube.com"
... ]
